WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:00,920
passing by

2
00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,260
I have no clothes at home

3
00:00:02,420 --> 00:00:04,750
Why don't you come over and pick out some clothes?

4
00:00:04,990 --> 00:00:10,800
She's so prettier than several girls

5
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:11,880
Like a fairy

6
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,120
Aren't they cold?

7
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,760
Wear this and come out

8
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:17,510
Didn't it start snowing in the middle of the night?

9
00:00:17,950 --> 00:00:20,900
The mall has long been closed, I understand.

10
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,340
These should be midnight moviegoers

11
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,500
As soon as I went out, I found that there was poisoned blood outside.

12
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:26,940
So I hid in the mall

13
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:30,220
The brother who survived by relying on the store's material reserves

14
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,820
We want to ask you guys from outside

15
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:34,220
Is there still poison in the blood now?

16
00:00:34,540 --> 00:00:36,260
Is there a rescue team or something to come to the rescue?

17
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:37,860
That's naturally poisonous

18
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:41,180
Nor any rescue team brothers

19
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:45,770
How many people can your car carry?

20
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:48,090
What does it have to do with you again?

21
00:00:48,750 --> 00:00:49,710
Even if you can bring it

22
00:00:50,420 --> 00:00:52,340
Can you find a mall better than this one?

23
00:00:52,580 --> 00:00:53,500
A more suitable place

24
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:56,410
At least the supplies here

25
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:58,850
Enough for the rest of you to survive for a long time
